recommend keep-going -- the shelf-ORDER writer is the last of the three the spec named and the only one still run by hand: seven firings across two laps, every repair the identical dedupe-and-sort, and index_row_bound already computes rows_misordered in order to compare it, so the writer is a flag beside a reading that exists.
